## Context
Shipping PR #28 was blocked because the conflict resolution required a merge commit with no tree change. The runner now provides a narrowly validated ancestry-only merge path, its resolver documentation uses that path, and regression tests cover successful two-parent creation plus unsafe-state rejection. All repository validation passed before committing.

